"""
TRACEATLAS / FACILITYINT — Local lawful defensive facility & site intelligence pipeline.

IMPORTANT SAFETY / POLICY NOTES:
- This is a local demo implementation.
- It does NOT access live property registries, GIS portals, permit systems, satellite imagery,
  facility-management systems, building-management systems, sensors, or private networks.
- It does NOT plan physical intrusion, sabotage, targeting, hostile reconnaissance,
  surveillance evasion, security-control bypass, or utility disruption.
- It does NOT expose private-person residences, employee routines, guard schedules,
  camera blind spots, access-control weaknesses, or tactical site exploitation details.
- It supports authorized, lawful, defensive, evidence-first facility intelligence only.
- Sample data is synthetic.
"""

