            "Separate owner, operator, occupant, and tenant relationships.",
            "Assess high-level function, capacity basis, construction lifecycle, and temporal changes.",
            "Analyze utility/logistics dependencies for resilience and business continuity only.",
            "Compare hazard exposure with mitigation, inspections, and emergency planning.",
